# IT 140 Module Four Assignment
# Higher/Lower Game Pseudocode
#
#

START hilow_game

    Generate a random number between the lower bound and upper bound

Display "Enter the lower bound:"
Input lowerBound

Display "Enter the upper bound:"
Input upperBound

Set randomNumber to a random value between lowerBound and upperBound

Display "Guess a number:"
Input userGuess

WHILE userGuess is not equal to randomNumber

    IF userGuess < randomNumber THEN
        Display "Nope, too low."
    ELSE
        Display "Nope, too high."
    END IF

    Display "Guess a number:"
    Input userGuess

END WHILE

Display "You got it!"

END hilow_game

